WEBVTT

00:12.090 --> 00:17.140
<b><i>Some soldiers died because I wished</i>
<i>to protect this village.</i></b>

00:19.180 --> 00:21.930
<b><i>I must brace my heart</i>
<i>if I'm going to be a general.</i></b>

00:23.730 --> 00:24.980
<b>Chojumaru.</b>

00:28.020 --> 00:32.190
<b>I want to offer my gratitude and deepest
apologies for how it all turned out.</b>

00:32.280 --> 00:36.410
<b>No need. I should apologize.
I acted recklessly.</b>

00:36.490 --> 00:39.580
<b>No, you were a big help.</b>

00:40.200 --> 00:42.500
<b>It's just as Fubuki pointed out.</b>

00:42.580 --> 00:46.330
<b>No one realized
that this village was in a vital location.</b>

00:46.920 --> 00:49.880
<b>We'll place guards to protect it
from now on.</b>

00:49.960 --> 00:52.260
<b>What will happen to the orphans?</b>

00:56.430 --> 00:58.680
<b>We'll take them in at Suwa Grand Shrine
for the time being.</b>

00:59.300 --> 01:01.930
<b>They're all grateful to Fubuki and you,</b>

01:02.020 --> 01:03.890
<b>so I don't think they would
have any objections.</b>

01:04.560 --> 01:05.770
<b>Okay.</b>

01:07.730 --> 01:12.900
<b>And since I put you in danger,</b>

01:12.990 --> 01:16.450
<b>I have to come clean about something.</b>

01:18.910 --> 01:22.700
<b>A phase when you can't see… the future?</b>

01:23.370 --> 01:27.080
<b>They're blurry and unclear,
as you may have noticed,</b>

01:27.170 --> 01:31.130
<b>but it's troublesome if I can't see
any visions in an emergency.</b>

01:32.460 --> 01:34.590
<b>Please keep this a secret between us.</b>

01:35.260 --> 01:38.890
<b>The gods hold power only
if there are people who believe in it.</b>

01:38.970 --> 01:42.430
<b>And there are people
who depend on and seek refuge in my power.</b>

01:44.060 --> 01:46.270
<b>That being said, Lord Tokiyuki,</b>

01:46.350 --> 01:51.020
<b>I would like just a little bit of help
to regain my power.</b>

01:54.030 --> 01:59.660
<b>I want you to know, too,
the source of my powers.</b>

02:00.620 --> 02:03.990
<b>There are wonders
that remain in this world</b>

02:04.080 --> 02:07.000
<b>that can't be measured
by military might nor intellect.</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:14.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

03:34.290 --> 03:38.920
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

03:41.880 --> 03:43.840
<b>Eel?</b>

03:44.720 --> 03:48.220
<b>I'll go catch some at the Tenryu River
if it is your command.</b>

03:48.310 --> 03:50.730
<b>What's gotten into you all of a sudden?</b>

03:54.190 --> 03:55.860
<b>Sorry.</b>

03:56.650 --> 04:00.110
<b>I just wanted to eat some suddenly.</b>

04:00.900 --> 04:06.410
<b><i>Remember, it's a secret</i>
<i>from everyone that I've lost my powers.</i></b>

04:10.660 --> 04:14.960
<b>Why do you need to eat an eel
in order for your powers to return?</b>

04:20.210 --> 04:23.380
<b>Last time this happened,
I was cured after I ate some eel.</b>

04:23.970 --> 04:27.430
<b>There are many possible ways
my holy power could come back,</b>

04:27.510 --> 04:31.560
<b>so I must learn from the past
and try them one by one.</b>

04:32.140 --> 04:34.100
<b>Eel is Suwa's specialty.</b>

04:34.190 --> 04:37.400
<b>In the winter, they carry plenty of fat,
and the meat is so tender…</b>

04:44.110 --> 04:48.700
<b>I can feel the power
coursing through my veins!</b>

04:50.580 --> 04:55.500
<b>But my holy power hasn't returned.
I guess it wasn't eel.</b>

04:56.580 --> 04:58.380
<b>Alpine leek?</b>

04:58.460 --> 05:04.630
<b>-I just… want to… try some?
-I can smell eel grilling! Where is it?</b>

05:06.640 --> 05:09.390
<b>Okay. I'll forage some
from the back hills.</b>

05:10.680 --> 05:12.470
<b>It's the Buddhist monks'
favorite vegetable</b>

05:12.560 --> 05:14.230
<b>while they train in the mountains.</b>

05:15.440 --> 05:20.730
<b>Its striking aroma has the power
to ward off evil.</b>

05:22.990 --> 05:26.070
<b>But this isn't doing the trick either.</b>

05:27.280 --> 05:31.740
<b>You want to take this rope?
Sure, of course. I don't mind…</b>

05:31.830 --> 05:37.540
<b>Shrine maiden attire?
There's plenty in the shed…</b>

05:40.790 --> 05:42.550
<b>But why would you need such a thing?</b>

05:43.130 --> 05:46.470
<b>Well, I've grown interested
in the clothes of the shrine.</b>

06:04.900 --> 06:05.900
<b>Right.</b>

06:07.030 --> 06:10.660
<b><i>In Shintoism, both men and women</i>
<i>are equally important.</i></b>

06:10.740 --> 06:13.660
<b><i>One particularly important role</i>
<i>is that of the shrine maiden.</i></b>

06:14.580 --> 06:17.370
<b><i>Since we have to keep my secret</i>
<i>from the shrine maidens,</i></b>

06:19.040 --> 06:22.630
<b><i>we'll perform a ritual with a doll</i>
<i>to regain my holy powers.</i></b>

06:26.920 --> 06:28.220
<b>A shrine maiden?</b>

06:28.760 --> 06:32.510
<b>No, this is all wrong! It doesn't look
like a shrine maiden at all!</b>

06:32.600 --> 06:37.600
<b>I need to make a shrine maiden!
A shrine maiden!</b>

06:38.770 --> 06:39.980
<b>I did it!</b>

06:44.980 --> 06:46.320
<b>This is weird, right?</b>

06:47.440 --> 06:48.740
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:49.530 --> 06:51.910
<b>He ate a bunch of things
to give him energy.</b>

06:52.660 --> 06:55.450
<b>And built a life-sized doll
of a shrine maiden.</b>

06:56.040 --> 06:58.040
<b>The rope is definitely to tie it up.</b>

07:02.210 --> 07:03.250
<b>My lord.</b>

07:03.960 --> 07:06.380
<b>Your kink… is wild.</b>

07:07.210 --> 07:09.930
<b>There's no way… that our Lord Tokiyuki
has developed</b>

07:10.010 --> 07:11.890
<b>such mature taste at his young age?</b>

07:11.970 --> 07:15.060
<b>You don't get it, Moritaka.</b>

07:15.140 --> 07:17.930
<b>Spoiled brats are more inclined
to grow up to be huge perverts.</b>

07:19.600 --> 07:20.690
<b>Calm down.</b>

07:21.230 --> 07:23.520
<b>Just because our lord is a huge pervert</b>

07:23.610 --> 07:26.280
<b>doesn't mean
it will affect our loyalty to him.</b>

07:26.900 --> 07:32.110
<b>Yeah, that's right. This is all to help
our lord restore the Kamakura shogunate.</b>

07:32.200 --> 07:35.030
<b>No matter how perverse
his shogunate might be!</b>

07:35.120 --> 07:38.910
<b>I agree! As his retainer, I will master
the art of war and perversion.</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:40.330
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:41.420 --> 07:44.000
<b>-He's a pervert for sure.
-We have a good lord.</b>

07:44.630 --> 07:46.090
<b>Yorishige!</b>

07:47.550 --> 07:49.420
<b>What is it? You look pale.</b>

07:49.510 --> 07:51.760
<b>It's not the time to be eating more eel!</b>

07:51.840 --> 07:54.800
<b>My retainers
are completely misunderstanding me</b>

07:54.890 --> 07:58.270
<b>because I'm running
these nonsensical errands for you!</b>

07:58.350 --> 08:00.140
<b>It doesn't have to be such a bad thing.</b>

08:00.230 --> 08:03.480
<b>A slightly enigmatic lord can exude
an inexplicable sense of authority.</b>

08:03.560 --> 08:05.440
<b>They're totally put off!</b>

08:06.060 --> 08:09.820
<b>You come with me! Go talk to everyone
and clear things up!</b>

08:09.900 --> 08:13.570
<b>I don't care about keeping
your holy power a secret!</b>

08:13.660 --> 08:19.870
<b>Hey, hey now.
I have just one more favor to ask of you.</b>

08:20.830 --> 08:24.210
<b>If you walk about four kilometers
from here, you'll see Mount Moriya,</b>

08:24.290 --> 08:27.250
<b>the sacred place where the divine spirits
of Suwa Grand Shrine reside.</b>

08:27.340 --> 08:30.510
<b>Go fetch me water
from the sacred wetland that runs there.</b>

08:30.590 --> 08:32.760
<b>I'll probably be back to normal
in a heartbeat if I drink it.</b>

08:35.430 --> 08:38.390
<b>Then why didn't you say so
in the first place!</b>

08:38.470 --> 08:42.270
<b>I wanted to eat eel and leek!</b>

08:45.060 --> 08:47.190
<b>What am I doing?</b>

08:47.690 --> 08:51.030
<b>I'm just being subjected to
Mr. Yorishige's</b>

08:51.110 --> 08:53.650
<b>perpetually unpredictable moods.</b>

08:55.780 --> 09:00.120
<b>Whether his holy power exists
in the first place is doubtful.</b>

09:00.700 --> 09:04.370
<b>All the power that he's shown
might just be coincidences.</b>

09:05.080 --> 09:10.300
<b>He leads such a large army. There's no
need to rely on some unpredictable power.</b>

09:31.730 --> 09:32.900
<b><i>Light?</i></b>

09:35.780 --> 09:39.910
<b><i>That's… the Kagura Dance</i>
<i>dedicated to the gods.</i></b>

09:40.490 --> 09:45.660
<b><i>Am I seeing things? It looks like</i>
<i>she's playing with countless lights.</i></b>

09:51.500 --> 09:53.800
<b>Big Brother! What brings you here?</b>

09:54.380 --> 09:57.050
<b>I just… came to fetch some water.</b>

09:58.840 --> 10:01.850
<b>What are you doing here, Shizuku?</b>

10:02.640 --> 10:08.100
<b>I was praying with them.
For the accomplishment of your goals.</b>

10:08.190 --> 10:12.150
<b>For the prosperity of Suwa.
And for peace in this world.</b>

10:13.570 --> 10:14.610
<b>With them?</b>

10:17.280 --> 10:18.660
<b>I see.</b>

10:18.740 --> 10:24.700
<b>Father must have wanted to show you
if he told you to come here.</b>

10:26.710 --> 10:27.790
<b>Big Brother.</b>

10:28.460 --> 10:30.040
<b>Crouch down a little.</b>

10:34.050 --> 10:35.340
<b>Close your eyes.</b>

10:45.140 --> 10:48.850
<b>There. Now you should be able to see
them for a little while.</b>

10:49.690 --> 10:52.480
<b>Open your eyes.</b>

10:57.950 --> 10:59.490
<b>What… are… they?</b>

11:00.240 --> 11:03.990
<b>They're Divine Beasts that live
in Suwa's sanctuary.</b>

11:04.080 --> 11:10.040
<b>Not that they lend their power to us,
but if I pray here, they'll protect us.</b>

11:11.250 --> 11:14.210
<b>Hey, if I look closely, I can see Botan!</b>

11:14.290 --> 11:16.840
<b>I think it moved in recently.</b>

11:17.920 --> 11:22.510
<b><i>I must be dreaming.</i>
<i>I can't believe they exist in our world.</i></b>

11:23.680 --> 11:29.140
<b><i>This was the last era</i>
<i>where people coexisted with the divine.</i></b>

11:30.230 --> 11:32.400
<b><i>If you saw a monster,</i>
<i>it meant an earthquake would come.</i></b>

11:32.480 --> 11:33.480
<b>GRAFFITI PROHIBITED</b>

11:33.560 --> 11:35.730
<b><i>You could also see a tengu flying</i>
<i>around town.</i></b>

11:35.820 --> 11:37.110
<b>CERTAINLY - NO FUTURE</b>

11:37.190 --> 11:40.650
<b><i>These types of stories were recorded</i>
<i>as fact in official documents.</i></b>

11:40.740 --> 11:42.160
<b>SUWA GRAND SHRINE STAFF
MR. S.Y</b>

11:42.240 --> 11:44.740
<b>The divine storm
that sank the Mongolian army?</b>

11:44.830 --> 11:46.950
<b>That was all because of our prayers.</b>

11:47.540 --> 11:50.830
<b><i>Such matters were seriously claimed</i>
<i>as achievements,</i></b>

11:50.910 --> 11:54.040
<b><i>and many shrines received real rewards.</i></b>

11:54.750 --> 11:59.130
<b><i>At this time,</i>
<i>prayer was pragmatic public work,</i></b>

11:59.210 --> 12:01.970
<b><i>and a vast budget was poured into it.</i></b>

12:03.140 --> 12:05.720
<b>This is what Father
wanted you to retrieve, isn't it?</b>

12:11.310 --> 12:15.060
<b>There. His holy power
is probably weakened?</b>

12:15.150 --> 12:16.190
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:21.740 --> 12:26.070
<b><i>I caught a glimpse of the fleeting wonder,</i>
<i>but it was blurry and unclear.</i></b>

12:26.910 --> 12:30.830
<b><i>They're a faint existence that don't seem</i>
<i>to have much influence on this world.</i></b>

12:31.870 --> 12:35.330
<b><i>Why did Mr. Yorishige show it to me?</i></b>

12:36.960 --> 12:42.220
<b><i>And Shizuku,</i>
<i>I don't think I know much about you.</i></b>

13:13.910 --> 13:15.500
<b>It looks good.</b>

13:20.960 --> 13:22.380
<b>Bring Tadayoshi.</b>

13:23.920 --> 13:26.930
<b>It's time to start envisioning
the future for our country.</b>

13:29.600 --> 13:32.310
<b>Tadayoshi!</b>

13:32.930 --> 13:36.140
<b>You came! Aren't you exhausted from
working hard at the imperial court?</b>

13:37.770 --> 13:38.610
<b>TADAYOSHI ASHIKAGA</b>

13:38.690 --> 13:40.690
<b>I am in perfect physical condition.</b>

13:40.770 --> 13:41.900
<b>TAKAUJI ASHIKAGA'S
YOUNGER BROTHER</b>

13:41.980 --> 13:43.570
<b>You seem well as always, big brother.</b>

13:43.650 --> 13:45.650
<b>I'm going to get straight to business.</b>

13:46.320 --> 13:51.990
<b>I want you to proceed towards
Kamakura and strengthen our defenses.</b>

13:53.160 --> 13:55.330
<b>Is it your usual "intuition"?</b>

13:55.410 --> 13:56.460
<b>Yes!</b>

13:57.670 --> 14:01.750
<b>I have a feeling that the Hojo survivors
will begin a revolt soon.</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:06.590
<b>Your intuition has always been
mostly right ever since we were young.</b>

14:07.800 --> 14:10.600
<b>When we were children,
I spent three whole days</b>

14:10.680 --> 14:13.390
<b>hiding a treasure
and creating a cipher to find it.</b>

14:13.470 --> 14:16.350
<b><i>Okay, not even Takauji can solve this!</i></b>

14:16.940 --> 14:19.520
<b><i>A treasure hunt? That sounds fun!</i></b>

14:19.610 --> 14:24.650
<b><i>Okay, I'm gonna start by looking</i>
<i>under the floor in Moronao's room!</i></b>

14:25.900 --> 14:29.360
<b>Before I gave you the cipher,
you guessed correctly with your intuition.</b>

14:30.070 --> 14:31.870
<b><i>I made the cipher</i>
<i>so that no one in this household</i></b>

14:31.950 --> 14:33.370
<b><i>was supposed to be able to solve it.</i></b>

14:39.710 --> 14:42.960
<b>Even if I can win with my intuition,
I can't beat your brains.</b>

14:44.050 --> 14:46.420
<b>I bet you already have plans
in that head of yours.</b>

14:46.970 --> 14:48.340
<b>Yes.</b>

14:49.050 --> 14:53.560
<b>I'm currently thinking of about 100
different defense strategies for Kamakura.</b>

14:54.390 --> 14:59.310
<b>Imagine if we, as brothers,
establish control over Kyo and Kamakura.</b>

14:59.390 --> 15:02.810
<b>All the warriors throughout
the land would obey the Ashikaga.</b>

15:05.190 --> 15:07.740
<b>By the way, don't you think that
100 is an overstatement?</b>

15:07.820 --> 15:09.910
<b>Aren't you really
only thinking of about 14?</b>

15:10.660 --> 15:13.490
<b>Is that the sort of thing
you can guess with intuition?</b>

15:16.950 --> 15:19.460
<b><i>Takauji is charismatic,</i>
<i>intuitive and a master of war.</i></b>

15:20.080 --> 15:22.710
<b><i>Tadayoshi is intellectual,</i>
<i>level-headed and logical.</i></b>

15:23.340 --> 15:26.090
<b><i>These two were complete opposite</i>
<i>types of geniuses,</i></b>

15:26.170 --> 15:28.630
<b><i>but they were very close as brothers.</i></b>

15:32.680 --> 15:34.220
<b>I know!</b>

15:35.220 --> 15:36.600
<b>Look, Tadayoshi.</b>

15:37.600 --> 15:40.140
<b>I drew a picture of the Buddha again!</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:51.110
<b>The Buddha is wonderful.
I feel calm just looking at him.</b>

16:09.720 --> 16:11.050
<b>Takauji.</b>

16:12.930 --> 16:16.260
<b>I managed to get high-quality
cedar boards made in Kitayama.</b>

16:17.010 --> 16:21.020
<b>I was just thinking that they would be
perfect for the wooden wall of this room.</b>

16:22.560 --> 16:23.520
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

16:23.600 --> 16:28.150
<b>How about this?
I'll give you the cedar boards for free.</b>

16:28.230 --> 16:34.160
<b>In exchange, could I
have this wonderful picture of the Buddha?</b>

16:37.910 --> 16:42.210
<b>You have an appreciation
for the Buddha too. Go ahead. Take it.</b>

16:46.080 --> 16:49.800
<b>I'm leaving all of Kamakura up to you.</b>

17:01.810 --> 17:03.060
<b>Somebody!</b>

17:03.980 --> 17:09.690
<b><i>Recently, my brother has surpassed</i>
<i>the level of just having a good intuition…</i></b>

17:11.490 --> 17:13.950
<b><i>It's gotten to the point</i>
<i>where I wonder if he is human…</i></b>

17:14.860 --> 17:17.030
<b>Keep the Buddha and burn everything else.</b>

17:17.120 --> 17:18.200
<b>-Sir.
-Sir.</b>

17:19.160 --> 17:23.080
<b>I can't show my brother's followers
a picture like this.</b>

17:23.870 --> 17:27.250
<b><i>I wonder if he's realized it himself.</i></b>

17:28.000 --> 17:33.840
<b><i>That he only sees the Buddha as prey.</i></b>

17:35.880 --> 17:38.300
<b><i>Takauji Ashikaga seized Kamakura,</i></b>

17:38.930 --> 17:42.220
<b><i>and Tadayoshi Ashikaga</i>
<i>protects that same Kamakura.</i></b>

17:42.810 --> 17:44.600
<b><i>There was less than a year and a half</i></b>

17:44.690 --> 17:49.110
<b><i>until the brothers who had risen to power</i>
<i>would clash against Tokiyuki Hojo.</i></b>

17:51.570 --> 17:54.650
<b>I knew that Shizuku
could see that I was not feeling myself!</b>

17:54.740 --> 17:59.830
<b>Who exactly is she?
And what was that mystical scene?</b>

18:01.290 --> 18:03.790
<b>It's not my place
to tell you about Shizuku.</b>

18:05.040 --> 18:08.580
<b>I'm sure she'll tell you soon enough.</b>

18:12.420 --> 18:15.420
<b>My holy power
is suddenly coming back to me!</b>

18:16.880 --> 18:18.510
<b>I think.</b>

18:18.590 --> 18:19.720
<b>You think?</b>

18:21.680 --> 18:26.310
<b>The Divine Beasts that you saw
were manifested by holy power.</b>

18:27.310 --> 18:31.980
<b>Holy power exists
where human eyes don't reach.</b>

18:32.570 --> 18:35.190
<b>Where human eyes don't reach?</b>

18:36.700 --> 18:39.490
<b>Just like you, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

18:40.160 --> 18:45.040
<b>In a world with more watchful eyes
and advanced social surveillance,</b>

18:45.870 --> 18:50.170
<b>someone as important
as you could not be a fugitive.</b>

18:50.830 --> 18:53.630
<b>The rogues we battled the other day
are in the same boat.</b>

18:53.710 --> 18:56.840
<b>People like them hold the divine power
to exist for the first time in history</b>

18:56.920 --> 18:58.840
<b>because no one is looking for them.</b>

18:58.930 --> 19:03.680
<b>However, these divine powers
are beginning to deplete.</b>

19:04.850 --> 19:08.560
<b>When the right to own land
was guaranteed through favor or service,</b>

19:08.640 --> 19:11.230
<b>people's attachment
to the land grew stronger,</b>

19:11.310 --> 19:13.730
<b>and the populated areas expanded.</b>

19:14.780 --> 19:16.740
<b>As the human world
becomes more observable,</b>

19:16.820 --> 19:19.360
<b>secret places and the power
that comes from them shrink.</b>

19:22.240 --> 19:26.700
<b>The wonders… cease to be wonders.</b>

19:34.880 --> 19:37.340
<b>Lake Suwa's ice is broken in half!</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:41.180
<b>Our famous location:
the famed God's Crossing at Lake Suwa.</b>

19:41.260 --> 19:45.390
<b>Currently, everyone believes that
Suwa Myojin creates it using holy power.</b>

19:46.470 --> 19:50.850
<b>But the more people lay eyes on it,</b>

19:51.400 --> 19:55.230
<b>I'm sure there will come a day that it
will be explained as a natural phenomenon.</b>

19:56.730 --> 20:02.070
<b>In other words, the stronger humans
become, the weaker the gods will be.</b>

20:04.160 --> 20:06.910
<b>As people begin to only look at reality,</b>

20:06.990 --> 20:10.210
<b>the gods and holy power
will all disappear.</b>

20:11.330 --> 20:13.540
<b>That's how the times change.</b>

20:24.340 --> 20:30.480
<b>Will you disappear one day too…
Mr. Yorishige?</b>

20:33.730 --> 20:38.150
<b>The halo of the gods has completely
recovered! My holy power is eternal!</b>

20:38.230 --> 20:40.990
<b>That's the source of your halo?</b>

20:41.070 --> 20:43.570
<b>What I'm trying to say is--</b>

20:45.780 --> 20:49.540
<b>This is the last time period
where we get to use divine powers!</b>

20:51.290 --> 20:56.080
<b>And your abilities are perfect
for this period.</b>

20:57.000 --> 21:02.470
<b>You're not a god, but just a human.
You should live your life to the fullest.</b>

21:09.850 --> 21:13.140
<b>The playground you stand on
will melt away one day.</b>

21:13.890 --> 21:17.650
<b>Play to your heart's content during this
period of change!</b>

21:18.730 --> 21:19.900
<b>Okay!</b>

21:23.070 --> 21:24.450
<b>Putting that aside.</b>

21:24.530 --> 21:28.160
<b>Mr. Yorishige, be sure to clean up
after all your playing around.</b>

21:32.910 --> 21:35.870
<b>I didn't want to see Lord Yorishige
like this.</b>

21:35.960 --> 21:37.630
<b>I overestimated him…</b>

21:37.710 --> 21:40.050
<b>I can't believe
he was making Lord Tokiyuki</b>

21:40.130 --> 21:42.170
<b>gather tools for his own pleasure.</b>

21:42.260 --> 21:43.510
<b>Whoa!</b>

21:44.510 --> 21:47.470
<b>I don't understand why he would do that
outside where everyone can see.</b>

21:47.550 --> 21:51.350
<b>I don't know. Maybe it's a form of play
only permitted to a god.</b>

21:51.430 --> 21:55.310
<b>It's so intense that he actually looks
like he's having a divine experience.</b>

21:57.400 --> 21:59.900
<b><i>It seems like holy power has gathered</i></b>

21:59.980 --> 22:03.530
<b><i>because Yorishige is free</i>
<i>in an isolated world.</i></b>

23:38.960 --> 23:39.830
<b>EPISODE 11 (YEAR OF 1334):
SAMURAIS WHO ARE EAGER TO DIE
& AN ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

23:38.960 --> 23:39.830
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
